# Copy to .env.local to make the website use the backend server instead of the sample data in the browser.
# Leave it out (or set 0) to keep the sample data, which needs no server.
VITE_USE_SERVER=1
# Where the API is. The default /api/v1 means "this website's own address"; while developing, Vite passes
# those calls to the backend on http://localhost:4000 (see vite.config.ts).
# VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
